@# The cafe has authored job actions; other shop and food hubs are implicit.

:: place.cafe
  @hub cafe

  The quiet clatter of cups fills {{place.name}}.

  @if flags.quest.cafe.employee and player.hygieneBand == "filthy"
    The manager makes it clear that you need to clean up before your next shift. They will not put you on customer service like this.
  @endif

  @choicegroup ""

    @choice "Ask about a job" -> cafe.job.application
      @when not flags.quest.cafe.employee
    @endchoice

    @choice "Work for one hour" -> @exit
      @time 1h
      @event-pool cafe.job.shift
      @when flags.quest.cafe.employee and time.minutesSinceMidnight >= 420 and time.minutesSinceMidnight <= 1260
      @require player.hygieneBand != "filthy" "The manager asks you to clean up before serving customers."
      @change money 7 "£7 wages"
    @endchoice
  @endchoicegroup
